# With the keyboard up, adding a new item ("Batteries") via list.addButton shows the new item,
# and the done item ("Buy milk") is still reachable by swiping, without closing the keyboard
# (TS-01-02) (covers: REQ-2).
launch
tap text "Groceries"
tap id "list.newItemField"
wait 300
type id "list.newItemField" "Batteries"
tap id "list.addButton"
wait 300
expect text "Batteries"
swipe id "list.itemCard" up
expect text "Buy milk"
